WEBVTT

00:11:28.946 --> 00:11:32.288
a sane reaction to insane circumstances,

00:11:32.312 --> 00:11:35.947
not as an aberrant symptom
of schizophrenia to be endured,

00:11:35.971 --> 00:11:39.211
but a complex, significant
and meaningful experience

00:11:39.235 --> 00:11:41.535
to be explored.

00:11:41.559 --> 00:11:43.818
Together, we envisage and enact a society

00:11:43.842 --> 00:11:46.295
that understands
and respects voice hearing,

00:11:46.319 --> 00:11:48.700
supports the needs
of individuals who hear voices,

00:11:48.724 --> 00:11:51.981
and which values them as full citizens.

00:11:52.005 --> 00:11:54.267
This type of society is not only possible,

00:11:54.291 --> 00:11:56.279
it's already on its way.

00:11:56.303 --> 00:12:00.073
To paraphrase Chavez, once
social change begins,